    { q: "Which precautions will you take during pesticide spraying? (any two)", model: "Wear a mask and gloves while spraying pesticides. Spray along the direction of the wind and keep children and animals away. Use the correct dilution of the pesticide.", keys: ["mask", "gloves", "direction of the wind", "correct dilution"] }
